UV-K1 Series ApeX Edition - fork with multiboot
================================================

This fork of N7SIX/UV-K1Series_ApeX-Edition_v7.6.0 includes components
ported from the F4HWN Edition Fusion firmware by Armel / F4HWN and
contributors (https://github.com/armel/uv-k1-k5v3-firmware-custom, commit
3a50e2127cd137c0561498041880e1decf17c4f4), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

  Unchanged:
    App/driver/mb_flash.c, App/driver/mb_flash.h
    App/ui/multiboot.c, App/ui/multiboot.h
    cmake/check_mb_ramfunc.cmake

  Adapted to this firmware:
    multiboot settings banking in App/driver/py25q16.c, App/driver/py25q16.h;
    multiboot integration in App/main.c, App/helper/boot.c, App/helper/boot.h,
    App/app/menu.c, App/ui/menu.c, App/ui/menu.h, Core/py32f071xb.ld,
    CMakeLists.txt, App/CMakeLists.txt and CMakePresets.json.
    The changes are described in this repository's commit history.

The NOTICE file of that project, as it stood at that commit, is reproduced
verbatim below. The license paths it names also exist in this repository.

